<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Tuesday 115,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Tuesday 115,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Actual interior Iowa and southern Minnesota hog receipts Tuesday were 115,000 head, compared with the estimate of 110,000, USDA said.</p>
<p>Opening trade was not well established. Early sales Barrows and Gilts were mostly $1.00 per cwt lower than midsession Tuesday.</p>
<p>				  Couontry		  Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    58.00 -59.00	   59.00 -60.00</p>
<p>Sows:  steady to 1.00 lower.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-500 lbs.  45.00 -46.00	   46.00 -47.50</p>
<p>500 lbs-up	     46.00 -50.00	   47.00 -51.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
